SUMMARY:Finland: Pay transparency bill: pay-gap reporting via the Incomes R
 egister (draft)
DESCRIPTION:Draft — not yet law\, 1 Jan 2027 (Proposed from 1 Jan 2027). 
 On 9 July 2026 the government proposed amendments to equal-pay legislation
  implementing the EU pay transparency directive\, with entry into force pr
 oposed for 1 January 2027. Employers regularly employing at least 100 work
 ers would report gender pay-gap data through the Incomes Register.\n\nSour
 ce: https://valtioneuvosto.fi/-/1271139/hallitus-esittaa-lakimuutoksia-pal
 kkauksen-lapinakyvyyden-vahvistamiseksi\nDetails: https://www.intelligentp
 ayroll.eu/countries/finland.html#fi-pay-transparency\n\nFor information on
 ly\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
